        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>50个行为经济学概念</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 10px 15px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .table {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #fff;\n  }\n  .term {\n    width: 34%;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    padding: 10px 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    width: 66%;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #222;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .desc:before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .desc-text {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .orange { background-color: #e8823a; }\n  .gray { background-color: #8c9296; }\n  .yellow { background-color: #e8b923; }\n  .blue { background-color: #4a90c4; }\n  .green { background-color: #6ab04c; }\n\n  .pink-bg { background-color: #f7dede; }\n  .green-bg { background-color: #dcedd8; }\n  .lblue-bg { background-color: #d6e6f2; }\n  .lpink-bg { background-color: #f6dfe6; }\n  .lyellow-bg { background-color: #f7efd0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>50个行为经济学概念</h1>\n\n<div class=\"table\">\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term orange\">内在动机（Intrinsic Motivation）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc pink-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">基于内在兴趣和满足感进行行动的动机，而非外部奖励或惩罚。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term gray\">比较效用（Relative Utility）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc green-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">人们对于收益和满足感的评估通常是基于相对参照点的比较，而非绝对数值。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term yellow\">消费者无知（Consumer Ignorance）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc lblue-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">消费者对于市场信息和产品特性的缺乏了解，导致决策受到影响。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term blue\">合作与竞争（Cooperation vs. Competition）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc lpink-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">人们在决策和行为中受到与他人合作或竞争的影响，从而改变决策策略。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term green\">持续效应（Sunk Cost Fallacy）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc lyellow-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">人们倾向于将过去已经发生的成本视为不可逆转，继续投入资源，即使当前决策并不理性。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term orange\">心理账户（Mental Account）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc lblue-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">人们对于不同资金来源的分配和使用会有不同的偏好和行为，形成不同的心理账户。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term gray\">失败回避（Loss Avoidance）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc green-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">人们更倾向于避免损失而非追求收益，因此在决策中可能会选择保守的选择。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term yellow\">群体迷思（Groupthink）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc lpink-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">在群体中，人们为了与他人保持一致和获得认同而放弃独立思考，导致决策偏差。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term blue\">时间不一致（Time Inconsistency）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc lyellow-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">人们在时间跨度较长的决策中容易受到即时满足的影响，而忽视长期利益。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term green\">心理障碍（Psychological Barrier）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc lblue-bg\"><span class=\"desc-text\">人们在决策中受到情绪、态度和信念等心理因素的影响，产生决策偏差。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
